        "created_at": "2017-03-18T00:00:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I asked a few questions some I'm sure may be covered but figured I'd ask just in case</p><ul>\n<li>Who originally taught martial arts to Mister Fixer</li>\n<li>Did any of his students besides Operative become a villain or hero</li>\n<li>Who taught Mister Fixer his mechanic skills</li>\n<li>What lead to his first death and how was he lured into that&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Why did it take so long for other heroes to notice since Dark Watch founded to find him but that was after Mister Fixer had been gone for a while.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>What was Zhu Long's plan for Mister Fixer upon resurrecting him</li>\n</ul>",
